## Cache hashed JS/CSS assets forever (they change filename on each build)
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

## Never cache index.html — always serve fresh so new chunk names load correctly
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

## Never cache service worker
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

## SPA fallback pages — short cache
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

